{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "日焼けをしたくないからといつもだったらきっちり下ろすブラインドを上げたまま景色を眺めて、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日の元気が心配だからといつもだったら参加できないみんなとの夜更かしをたまーにして、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分らしくない選択をすることが増えた気がしたツアー期間でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "自分らしくないことをできるのは幸せですね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "誰かに支えてもらっている証拠です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "眩しくても眺めていたい景色に出会えたのは素敵な場所に連れて行ってくれるBuddiesのおかげで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "眠たくても一緒にいたいと思える人と出会えたのは櫻坂46のおかげです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しかったー！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもとはちょっと違う特別が皆さんにもありましたか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あってもなくても、楽しかったって思ってくれていたらいいな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は皆さんが来てくださってとてもとても嬉しかった！皆さんといっぱい目があったし、声出してくれているのもいっぱい見ました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ね、目合いましたよね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうBuddiesに会いたい気持ちだけど、しばらくは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また最高のものをみていただけるように頑張る時間だね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "頑張りましょー！お互い！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobzuSpaN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいいおともだち！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobCwGWFJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また会おうね"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobo1iE64.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob4e5VwU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "けっこう仲良い"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mob6Dplvb.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "後輩のメイク直し中に変なポーズで圧をかける遊びをしてた　変な二人組　（うそだよってちゃんといってるよ）"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobsTZynD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お姉さん　ズ　いつも、いつも通りです"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobtEZkxW.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一刻も早く食べたい人たち"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobx9D76y.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "噂のみゅーづ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobyQDoKP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "りーたん、チィタン、わんわん、ありさんこいぬ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobVvzAgK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobVceqpK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなまるくん　いっぱい喋った"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobeSbxVn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "全公演リハ見てた"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobEAhyWt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんか初対面の顔つきになっちゃったって二人で笑った"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobRWBZhX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ももっしー　いっぱい遊んでくれてありがとう"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobCl9nAp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "トリさんっぽい？　チームトリさん"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/moba28iLQ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なぎ語録、順調です"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobSRjYRN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "イナっち　私だけの呼び方だよ"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobhGRURX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "優ってやさしい　おもしろいし"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobE9sJKL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はいはい、うどん脳はみおちゃんのね"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobcpLoHo.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobJ7mweE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だーーーいすきです　最近は前より伝わっていそうです"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobZVwM2u.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "移動してる！😆なんで！😆　あ！😄ゆづが置いたの！🫢って反応してくださるからいっぱい遊んじゃった"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きなやさしい先輩"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobqVzgaN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ね、びっくりしてほしくて一緒におすわりの練習したもんね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても大好き"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202608/mobDWpovp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あっという間の夏だった"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "頑張りましょー！って言ったけど、日々行かなきゃいけないところに行くだけで十分頑張ってると思います"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日から9月"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "無理せず、たまには必要なら無理もしながら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたらしくいられますように！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それではまたね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆーづより"}], "source": "official"}